# Local Claude Code config — not shared with the team, EXCEPT the project skills below.
#
# `.claude/skills/` holds four skills that are about this repository rather than about one
# machine: add-mcp-tool (the tool_permissions migration and admin-category steps a new tool
# needs before any role can reach it), implement-connector (the runSync shape and the
# never-TRUNCATE rule), and grant-writing / grant-writing-mcp. Ignoring all of `.claude/`
# meant those could never reach main, so every clone but this one lacked them.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# Personal working notes. Real work gets an OpenProject work package instead.
TODO.local.md

# Raw grant source material (Drive exports). Large, and it holds funder
# correspondence and unredacted student data — never commit it.
packages/grants/data/

# Drafted answer packages awaiting staff review. Same disclosure concern as
# data/, and worse: these pair funder names with operating deficits by fiscal
# year, wage aggregates, and per-employer placement counts. They are also
# pre-review by construction, and a drafted answer found in git history reads
# like approved language. See packages/grants/drafts/README.md.
# Ignore the contents, not the directory: git does not descend into an excluded
# directory, so `drafts/` followed by a negation would keep the README out too.
packages/grants/drafts/*
!packages/grants/drafts/README.md

# Python bytecode from the parity regeneration scripts in packages/grants/scripts/
__pycache__/

# Local mirror of the Grants Shared Drive (1,234 files). Same reason as
# packages/grants/data/ above: funder correspondence, unredacted student data,
# and — per the H2.5 sweep — portal credentials in 60 of the .docx files.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash: unanchored, `data/` matches a directory named
# `data` at ANY depth, and `git check-ignore` confirmed it swallowing
# apps/hq/app/data/ and connectors/google-sheets/src/data/. Nothing lived there
# yet, so nothing was lost — but the next source directory named `data` would
# have gone uncommitted with no error anywhere.
/data/

# Local agent tooling, not shared with the team
.opencode/
EchoesVault/